# direnv: enter this repo's dev shell automatically, for anything that
# starts here - a terminal, an editor launched from one, and every
# process an editor spawns. Install direnv and nix-direnv, then run
# `direnv allow` once per checkout.
#
# Without it, everything still works: `nix develop` by hand, and the
# .vscode wrappers find the toolchain on their own.
use flake
